sequenceDiagram
    actor Admin
    participant Frontend as Frontend Admin
    participant Auth as auth-service
    participant AdminService as admin-service
    participant Retrieval as retrieval-service
    participant Preprocessing as preprocessing-service

    Admin->>Frontend: Ajuster les parametres RAG
    Frontend->>Auth: Verifier l'authentification
    Auth-->>Frontend: Admin autorise
    Frontend->>AdminService: Envoyer les nouveaux parametres
    AdminService->>AdminService: Identifier le type de reglage

    alt Reglage de retrieval / reranking
        AdminService->>Retrieval: Mettre a jour le reranking
        Retrieval-->>AdminService: Configuration appliquee
    else Reglage de chunking / preprocessing
        AdminService->>Preprocessing: Mettre a jour la strategie de chunking
        Preprocessing-->>AdminService: Configuration appliquee
    end

    AdminService-->>Frontend: Retourner le nouvel etat
    Frontend-->>Admin: Afficher la confirmation des parametres
